<title>USA: RPM sees Tremco neutral to earnings in fy97.</title>
<headline>RPM sees Tremco neutral to earnings in fy97.</headline>
<dateline>MEDINA, Ohio 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>- RPM Inc said Monday the sole reason for the decrease in earnings in the third quarter was the results of the operations of B.F. Goodrich's Tremco Inc, acquired on Feb. 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said that as expected, the acquisition costs of Tremco, combined with a slow seasonal period, decreased earnings.</p>
<p>The company said Tremco is expected to be neutral to earnings in the full 1997 fiscal year.</p>
</text>
